cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Ultrone
message: >-
  If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Ultrone Contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mr-Nobody-Anonymous/ultrone"
url: "https://github.com/Mr-Nobody-Anonymous/ultrone"
abstract: >-
  Ultrone is a simulation-only, multi-domain battlefield AI research
  platform with a 15-layer cognitive architecture, a 7-tier memory system,
  human-in-the-loop safety gates with a tamper-evident audit chain, a
  canonical benchmark suite, and an integrated Ultron collective-memory
  system for cross-agent shared memory, skills, and harnesses.
keywords:
  - artificial-intelligence
  - multi-agent-systems
  - reinforcement-learning
  - cognitive-architecture
  - simulation
  - research-platform
license: MIT
